{
  "info": {
    "name": "TestLookup API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for TestLookup — AI-powered software testing intelligence platform.\n\n## Getting Started\n1. Import both the collection and the environment file\n2. Run **Auth > Dev Login (Admin)** to get a JWT token (auto-saved)\n3. Run **Projects > List Projects** and copy a `project_id` into the environment\n4. Explore any endpoint — auth headers and variables are wired up automatically\n\n## Authentication\n- JWT Bearer token: auto-attached from `{{access_token}}`\n- API Key: set `{{api_key}}` and use the `X-API-Key` header\n- Dev login: only works when `APP_ENV=development` and `DEV_AUTO_LOGIN_ENABLED=true`\n\n## Variables\nConfigure `{{base_url}}`, `{{project_id}}`, and auth tokens in the environment.",
    "_postman_id": "tl-api-collection-v1",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": ["// Collection-level pre-request — auth token attached via collection auth"]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Authentication, registration, profile management, and token refresh.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Dev Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('refresh_token', json.refresh_token);",
                  "    console.log('Token saved to environment');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/dev-login?role=admin",
            "description": "Quick login without credentials (dev environment only).\nRequires `APP_ENV=development` and `DEV_AUTO_LOGIN_ENABLED=true`.\nAuto-saves the JWT token to environment variables."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Dev Login (QA Engineer)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('refresh_token', json.refresh_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/dev-login?role=qa_engineer"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newuser@example.com\",\n  \"username\": \"newuser\",\n  \"full_name\": \"New User\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register",
            "description": "Self-service registration. Creates user with VIEWER role and must_change_password=True."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('refresh_token', json.refresh_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "admin", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "admin123", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Standard login with username/email + password. Returns JWT access + refresh tokens."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User (Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Profile (Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"full_name\": \"Updated Name\",\n  \"avatar_color\": \"#3B82F6\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"current_password\": \"oldpassword\",\n  \"new_password\": \"NewSecurePass456!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/change-password"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('refresh_token', json.refresh_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Users (Dropdown)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/users?limit=50"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
